    "match_check_profile": "owner has configured match checks; coaching adjustment conflict compatibility unknown until verified in Madden. Match and Nickel packages must share a verified coherent active profile.",
    "red_zone_policy": "Model may favor Tampa 2 Contain from nickel_stock with 24 Base when red-zone context supports it, but not forced; no extra red-zone formation.",
    "guide_role_policy": "Match guide user role keyed by EXACT candidate + offensive alignment + configured check; do not transfer to modified Nickel stock variant or Zone It without validation.",
    "unknown_user": "Explicitly mark USER UNVERIFIED / do not claim a verified player, not eligible for unattended live recommendation until owner validates.",
    "match_cover9_note": "Owner t358u allowed the Match-package Cover 9 Show 2 call into the live book (live_eligible true). The Civil match guide still names generic Cover 9; USER transfer from that guide stays UNVERIFIED until confirmed in game.",
    "playbook_policy": "exact names only; do not add Dime 2-3, Nickel 2-4 (not Wide), Nickel Mug or other formations",
